{"version":1,"content":"<p>英偉達董事會周一投票決定恢復黃仁勳的行政總裁職務，結束了此前重創人工智能（AI）供應鏈的領導層危機。受此消息提振，亞洲股市周二普遍上漲。英偉達晶片代工廠商台積電股價大漲9.9%，觸及單日漲幅上限，單日市值增加5.2萬億新台幣（約合1580億美元）。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1587798.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-24T07:43:57.636906+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":129,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-24T07:33:40+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-24T07:37:17.477390+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-24T07:37:17.477390+00:00","content_hash":"e3cae592a5109c09a5ac3bfbe84183dff0385688255a64e7a2c53ec4c503a0a1","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}